  "Out-tanks Moe's bouncing attacks, using Hardy Hard Hat to reduce each hit throughout sustained exchanges.": "Supera os ataques saltitantes de Moe, usando Hardy Hard Hat para reduzir cada golpe durante trocas sustentadas.",
