  "Out-trades Janet at equal range by landing both passes of each pickaxe against her single focused shot.": "Supera Janet em igual alcance acertando ambos os passes de cada picareta contra seu único tiro focado.",
  "Outdamages Chuck in Heist base races with long-range six-bullet volleys while he spends time placing Posts.": "Supera Chuck em corridas de base Heist com rajadas de seis balas de longo alcance enquanto ele passa o tempo colocando Postes.",
  "Outdamages Chuck in Heist base races with point-blank shotgun bursts and survives his predictable passes with tank-level health.": "Supera Chuck em corridas de base Heist com rajadas de espingarda à queima-roupa e sobrevive a seus passes previsíveis com saúde de nível de tanque.",
  "Outdamages Chuck in Heist base races, chaining dashes to the safe while orbiting notes deliver sustained damage.": "Supera Chuck em corridas básicas de Heist, encadeando ataques ao cofre enquanto notas em órbita causam danos sustentados.",
